# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# KAP Intelligence Terminal — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in values
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── SUPABASE (Required — primary database) ──────────────────────────────────
# Source: Supabase Dashboard → Settings → API
# After creating your Supabase project, run supabase/migration.sql in the SQL Editor
# Then run supabase/seed.sql to load Vaseline UK data
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_ID.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ...your-anon-key

# ─── HUBSPOT (Required — contacts, deals, pipeline) ──────────────────────────
# Source: HubSpot → Settings → Integrations → Private Apps → Create
# Scopes needed: crm.objects.contacts.read, crm.objects.deals.read
# Portal: 145447962 (EU instance: app-eu1.hubspot.com)
HUBSPOT_ACCESS_TOKEN=pat-eu1-...your-private-app-token

# ─── ANTHROPIC (Required — AI engine for Layers 4, 8, 10, Coach, Web Summary)
# Source: console.anthropic.com → API Keys
# Model used: claude-sonnet-4-20250514
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...your-api-key

# ─── GMAIL (Optional — email intelligence, Layer 5 interactions) ─────────────
# Source: Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → Credentials → OAuth 2.0
# Connected account: alex@campfire.co.uk
# Scopes needed: gmail.readonly
# Initial tokens obtained via OAuth flow; refresh token auto-renews
GMAIL_ACCESS_TOKEN=ya29.your-gmail-access-token
GMAIL_REFRESH_TOKEN=1//your-gmail-refresh-token
GMAIL_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRET=GOCSPX-your-client-secret

# ─── GOOGLE CALENDAR (Optional — meeting intelligence, Layer 7 events) ───────
# Source: Same Google Cloud project as Gmail
# Scopes needed: calendar.readonly
GOOGLE_CALENDAR_TOKEN=ya29.your-calendar-access-token

# ─── SLACK (Optional — internal comms monitoring) ─────────────────────────────
# Source: api.slack.com → Your Apps → Create New App → OAuth & Permissions
# Scopes needed: search:read, channels:read
# Channels monitored: #vas-uk-gluta-lip-2026, #vas-uk-gluta-body-y2,
#   #unilever-global, #finance-general, #general
SLACK_BOT_TOKEN=xoxb-your-slack-bot-token

# ─── CLAY (Optional — contact enrichment, Layers 2 & 3) ─────────────────────
# Source: app.clay.com → Settings → API Keys
# Used for: email enrichment, work history, thought leadership discovery
CLAY_API_KEY=your-clay-api-key

# ─── SUPERMETRICS (Optional — campaign performance metrics) ──────────────────
# Source: Supermetrics Hub → API Keys
# Pulls: reach, impressions, engagement rate, video views, follower growth, CPM
SUPERMETRICS_API_KEY=your-supermetrics-api-key

# ─── META AD LIBRARY (Optional — competitor/brand ad monitoring) ─────────────
# Source: developers.facebook.com → My Apps → Marketing API access
# Used for: detecting competitor campaigns, brand ad activity
META_AD_LIBRARY_TOKEN=your-meta-ad-library-token

# ─── GOOGLE NEWS API (Optional — news monitoring) ────────────────────────────
# Source: newsapi.org or Google Custom Search API
# Used for: industry news signals, company mentions
GOOGLE_NEWS_API_KEY=your-google-news-api-key

# ─── COMPANIES HOUSE (Optional — UK corporate data) ─────────────────────────
# Source: developer.company-information.service.gov.uk → Register & create API key
# Used for: corporate filings, director changes
COMPANIES_HOUSE_API_KEY=your-companies-house-api-key

# ─── PHASE 3 (Not yet implemented) ──────────────────────────────────────────
